{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1545933-more-than-three-paths","id":1545933,"title":"More than three Paths","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-11-15T07:32:16-08:00","id":1545933,"title":"More than three Paths","content":"Long time lurker, first time poster. I had a question regarding gaining Path dots during character advancement - the chart on pg. 39 of Core mentions buying dots in &quot;a new or existing Path (maximum of five Paths)&quot; which struck me as odd that it is a maximum of five *Paths* not five *dots*, suggesting that PCs aren't limited to just their three initial Origin/Role/Society Paths. However, I ran a year-and-change long TC game, and none of my players were interested in this possibility, sticking to and upgrading their initial Paths only. My question is, has anyone ever done this? To follow up, is it game-breaking? Is this a way to have PCs that are, say, in the Aeon Society but also moonlight with the Pharaoh's Lightkeepers or something like that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28449-gom-jabbarwocky","name":"gom jabbarwocky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28449_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T19:30:41-08:00","id":1545979,"title":"","content":"I have had fourth and even fifth paths in virtually every game I have run. I haven't found it to be game breaking at all. It is just a systemic way to reflect character growth and change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-15T19:30:41-08:00","id":1545980,"title":"","content":"What I noticed about paths:<br /> <br /> Most games will keep the 3 paths as the only ones for not having a reason to add others.<br /> <br /> Talents usually have a better chance of exploring paths as Novas and Psions usually focus on their powers when advancing.<br /> <br /> I see a good use of additional paths if the characters start to get involved in politics, asking favors and things like that. You start to need more options if you use often, or if you interact with different societies.<br /> <br /> Another option is to give a better attitude from NPCs of your paths. It usually is a good way to bring people to pay attention in the paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}